---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear()
---

<footer class="rounded-lg shadow m-4 bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-lg w-full xl:w-[1120px] mx-auto mb-10">
  <div id="contacto" class="w-full mx-auto max-w-screen-xl p-6 md:flex md:items-center md:justify-between md:gap-8">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-yellow-200">¿Hablamos?</h2>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/80">Estoy disponible para nuevos proyectos y oportunidades.</p>
      <a
        class="mt-3 inline-flex rounded text-sm font-medium text-white underline decoration-yellow-200 underline-offset-4 transition hover:text-yellow-100 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-yellow-200"
        href="mailto:iyustlop@gmail.com"
      >
        iyustlop@gmail.com
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm font-medium text-white/90 md:mt-0">
      <a class="hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-yellow-200" href="/#sobre-mi">Sobre mí</a>
      <a class="hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-yellow-200" href="/#top">Volver al inicio</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10 px-6 py-4 text-xs text-white/60">
    © {currentYear} iyustlop. Todos los derechos reservados.
  </div>
</footer>
